<span id="alg1.l6.4" class="ltx_text" style="float:right;"><math id="alg1.l6.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\triangleright" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo>⊳</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\triangleright</annotation></semantics></math> <math id="alg1.l6.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\gamma_{i}=\begin{cases}\scalebox{0.9}{${\min}\Big(\frac{S_{\text{churn}}}{N},\scalebox{0.8}{$\sqrt{2}{-}1$}\Big)$}&amp;\text{if }\scalebox{0.9}{$t_{i}{\in}[S_{\text{tmin}}{,}S_{\text{tmax}}]$}\\
0&amp;\text{otherwise}\end{cases}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>γ</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo>{</mo><mtable columnspacing="5pt" rowspacing="0pt"><mtr><mtd class="ltx_align_left" columnalign="left"><mpadded style="width:78.8pt;height:14.4pt;vertical-align:-3.6pt;" depth="3.6pt" height="10.8pt" width="78.8pt"><mi>min</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo maxsize="1.600em" minsize="1.600em">(</mo><mfrac><msub><mi>S</mi><mtext>churn</mtext></msub><mi>N</mi></mfrac><mo>,</mo><mpadded style="width:10.7pt;height:5.2pt;vertical-align:-0.0pt;" depth="0.0pt" height="5.2pt" width="10.7pt"><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mpadded><mo maxsize="1.600em" minsize="1.600em">)</mo></mrow></mpadded></mtd><mtd class="ltx_align_left" columnalign="left"><mrow><mtext>if </mtext><mtext>
<div class="ltx_inline-block ltx_transformed_outer" style="width:63.6pt;height:9.1pt;vertical-align:-2.3pt;"><span class="ltx_transformed_inner" style="transform:translate(-3.5pt,0.5pt) scale(0.9,0.9) ;"> 
<p class="ltx_p"><math alttext="t_{i}{\in}[S_{\text{tmin}}{,}S_{\text{tmax}}]" display="inline"><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>∈</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mrow><msub><mi>S</mi><mtext>tmin</mtext></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>S</mi><mtext>tmax</mtext></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow></math></p> 
</span></div></mtext></mrow></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd class="ltx_align_left" columnalign="left"><mn>0</mn></mtd><mtd class="ltx_align_left" columnalign="left"><mtext>otherwise</mtext></mtd></mtr></mtable></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\gamma_{i}=\begin{cases}\scalebox{0.9}{${\min}\Big(\frac{S_{\text{churn}}}{N},\scalebox{0.8}{$\sqrt{2}{-}1$}\Big)$}&amp;\text{if }\scalebox{0.9}{$t_{i}{\in}[S_{\text{tmin}}{,}S_{\text{tmax}}]$}\\
0&amp;\text{otherwise}\end{cases}</annotation></semantics></math>
</span>
</div>
<div id="alg1.l7" class="ltx_listingline">
              <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">7:</span>
              
              
               <span id="alg1.l7.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">sample</span> <math id="alg1.l7.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\bm{\epsilon}_{i}\sim\mathcal{N}\big(\mathbf{0},~S_{\text{noise}}^{2}~\mathbf{I}\big)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi class="ltx_mathvariant_bold-italic" mathvariant="bold-italic">ϵ</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>∼</mo><mrow><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒩</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo maxsize="1.200em" minsize="1.200em">(</mo><mn>𝟎</mn><mo>,</mo><mrow><msubsup><mi>S</mi><mtext>noise</mtext><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>𝐈</mi></mrow><mo maxsize="1.200em" minsize="1.200em">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\bm{\epsilon}_{i}\sim\mathcal{N}\big(\mathbf{0},~S_{\text{noise}}^{2}~\mathbf{I}\big)</annotation></semantics></math>

</div>
<div id="alg1.l8" class="ltx_listingline">
              <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">8:</span>
              
              
               <math id="alg1.l8.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\hat{t}_{i}\leftarrow t_{i}+\gamma_{i}t_{i}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>t</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">←</mo><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>+</mo><mrow><msub><mi>γ</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\hat{t}_{i}\leftarrow t_{i}+\gamma_{i}t_{i}</annotation></semantics></math>
<span id="alg1.l8.2" class="ltx_text" style="float:right;"><math id="alg1.l8.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\triangleright" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo>⊳</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\triangleright</annotation></semantics></math> Select temporarily increased noise level <math id="alg1.l8.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\hat{t}_{i}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>t</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mi>i</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\hat{t}_{i}</annotation></semantics></math>
</span>
</div>
<div id="alg1.l9" class="ltx_listingline">
              <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">9:</span>
              
              
               <math id="alg1.l9.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\hat{\mathbf{x}}_{i}^{\tau}\leftarrow\mathbf{x}_{i}^{\tau}+\raisebox{0.0pt}{$\sqrt{\raisebox{0.0pt}[7.74998pt][1.29167pt]{$\hat{t}_{i}^{2}-t_{i}^{2}$}}$}~\bm{\epsilon}_{i}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐱</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mi>i</mi><mi>τ</mi></msubsup><mo stretchy="false">←</mo><mrow><msubsup><mi>𝐱</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>τ</mi></msubsup><mo>+</mo><mrow><mpadded voffset="0.0pt"><msqrt><mpadded voffset="0.0pt"><msubsup><mover accent="true"><mi>t</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mi>i</mi><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mo>−</mo><msubsup><mi>t</mi><mi>i</mi><mn>2</mn></msubsup></mpadded></msqrt></mpadded><mo lspace="0.330em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi class="ltx_mathvariant_bold-italic" mathvariant="bold-italic">ϵ</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\hat{\mathbf{x}}_{i}^{\tau}\leftarrow\mathbf{x}_{i}^{\tau}+\raisebox{0.0pt}{$\sqrt{\raisebox{0.0pt}[7.74998pt][1.29167pt]{$\hat{t}_{i}^{2}-t_{i}^{2}$}}$}~\bm{\epsilon}_{i}</annotation></semantics></math>
<span id="alg1.l9.2" class="ltx_text" style="float:right;"><math id="alg1.l9.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\triangleright" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo>⊳</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\triangleright</annotation></semantics></math> Add new noise to move from <math id="alg1.l9.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="t_{i}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">t_{i}</annotation></semantics></math> to <math id="alg1.l9.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="t_{i}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">t_{i}</annotation></semantics></math>
</span>
</div>
<div id="alg1.l10" class="ltx_listingline">
              <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">10:</span>
              
              
               <math id="alg1.l10.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\bm{d}_{i}\leftarrow\big(\mathbf{x}_{i}^{\tau}-D_{\theta}(\mathbf{x}_{i}^{\tau},\mathbf{z}_{0}^{\tau};\hat{t}_{i})\big)/\hat{t}_{i}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>𝒅</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">←</mo><mrow><mrow><mo maxsize="1.200em" minsize="1.200em">(</mo><mrow><msubsup><mi>𝐱</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>τ</mi></msubsup><mo>−</mo><mrow><msub><mi>D</mi><mi>θ</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msubsup><mi>𝐱</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>τ</mi></msubsup><mo>,</mo><msubsup><mi>𝐳</mi><mn>0</mn><mi>τ</mi></msubsup><mo>,</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>t</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo maxsize="1.200em" minsize="1.200em">)</mo></mrow><mo>/</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>t</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\bm{d}_{i}\leftarrow\big(\mathbf{x}_{i}^{\tau}-D_{\theta}(\mathbf{x}_{i}^{\tau},\mathbf{z}_{0}^{\tau};\hat{t}_{i})\big)/\hat{t}_{i}</annotation></semantics></math>
<span id="alg1.l10.2" class="ltx_text" style="float:right;"><math id="alg1.l10.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\triangleright" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo>⊳</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\triangleright</annotation></semantics></math> Evaluate <math id="alg1.l10.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathrm{d}\mathbf{x}/\mathrm{d}t" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mrow><mi>d</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>𝐱</mi></mrow><mo>/</mo><mi>d</mi></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathrm{d}\mathbf{x}/\mathrm{d}t</annotation></semantics></math> at <math id="alg1.l10.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="t_{i}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">t_{i}</annotation></semantics></math>
</span>
</div>
<div id="alg1.l11" class="ltx_listingline">
              <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">11:</span>
              
              
               <math id="alg1.l11.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathbf{x}_{i-1}^{\tau}\leftarrow\mathbf{x}_{i}^{\tau}+(t_{i-1}-\hat{t}_{i})\bm{d}_{i}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mi>𝐱</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>τ</mi></msubsup><mo stretchy="false">←</mo><mrow><msubsup><mi>𝐱</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>τ</mi></msubsup><mo>+</mo><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>t</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>𝒅</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathbf{x}_{i-1}^{\tau}\leftarrow\mathbf{x}_{i}^{\tau}+(t_{i-1}-\hat{t}_{i})\bm{d}_{i}</annotation></semantics></math>
<span id="alg1.l11.2" class="ltx_text" style="float:right;"><math id="alg1.l11.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\triangleright" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo>⊳</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\triangleright</annotation></semantics></math> Take Euler step from <math id="alg1.l11.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="t_{i}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">t_{i}</annotation></semantics></math> to <math id="alg1.l11.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="t_{i-1}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>t</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">t_{i-1}</annotation></semantics></math>
</span>
</div>
<div id="alg1.l12" class="ltx_listingline">
              <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">12:</span>
              
              
               <span id="alg1.l12.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">if</span> <math id="alg1.l12.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="t_{i-1}\neq 0" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>≠</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">t_{i-1}\neq 0</annotation></semantics></math> <span id="alg1.l12.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">then</span>

</div>
<div id="alg1.l13" class="ltx_listingline">
              <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">13:</span>
              
              
                 <math id="alg1.l13.m1" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="{\bm{d}\mathrlap{\hskip 0.74997pt{}^{\prime}}}_{i}\leftarrow\big(\mathbf{x}_{i-1}^{\tau}-D_{\theta}(\mathbf{x}_{i-1}^{\tau},\mathbf{z}_{0}^{\tau};t_{i-1})\big)/t_{i-1}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>𝒅</mi><mmultiscripts><mo stretchy="false">←</mo><mi>i</mi><mrow></mrow><mprescripts></mprescripts><mrow></mrow><mo>′</mo></mmultiscripts><mrow><mo maxsize="1.200em" minsize="1.200em">(</mo><msubsup><mi>𝐱</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>τ</mi></msubsup><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>D</mi><mi>θ</mi></msub><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msubsup><mi>𝐱</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>τ</mi></msubsup><mo>,</mo><msubsup><mi>𝐳</mi><mn>0</mn><mi>τ</mi></msubsup><mo>;</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo maxsize="1.200em" minsize="1.200em">)</mo></mrow><mo>/</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{\bm{d}\mathrlap{\hskip 0.74997pt{}^{\prime}}}_{i}\leftarrow\big(\mathbf{x}_{i-1}^{\tau}-D_{\theta}(\mathbf{x}_{i-1}^{\tau},\mathbf{z}_{0}^{\tau};t_{i-1})\big)/t_{i-1}</annotation></semantics></math>
<span id="alg1.l13.2" class="ltx_text" style="float:right;"><math id="alg1.l13.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\triangleright" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo>⊳</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\triangleright</annotation></semantics></math> Apply 2<sup id="alg1.l13.2.1" class="ltx_sup">nd</sup> order correction
</span>
</div>
<div id="alg1.l14" class="ltx_listingline">
              <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">14:</span>
              
              
                 <math id="alg1.l14.m1" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="\mathbf{x}_{i-1}^{\tau}\leftarrow\hat{\mathbf{x}}_{i}^{\tau}+(t_{i-1}-\hat{t}_{i})\big(\frac{1}{2}\bm{d}_{i}+\frac{1}{2}{\bm{d}\mathrlap{\hskip 0.74997pt{}^{\prime}}}_{i}\big)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mi>𝐱</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>τ</mi></msubsup><mo stretchy="false">←</mo><msubsup><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐱</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mi>i</mi><mi>τ</mi></msubsup><mo>+</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>t</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mrow><mo maxsize="1.200em" minsize="1.200em">(</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><msub><mi>𝒅</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mi>𝒅</mi><mmultiscripts><mo maxsize="1.200em" minsize="1.200em">)</mo><mi>i</mi><mrow></mrow><mprescripts></mprescripts><mrow></mrow><mo>′</mo></mmultiscripts></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathbf{x}_{i-1}^{\tau}\leftarrow\hat{\mathbf{x}}_{i}^{\tau}+(t_{i-1}-\hat{t}_{i})\big(\frac{1}{2}\bm{d}_{i}+\frac{1}{2}{\bm{d}\mathrlap{\hskip 0.74997pt{}^{\prime}}}_{i}\big)</annotation></semantics></math>
     
</div>
<div id="alg1.l15" class="ltx_listingline">
              <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">15:</span>
              
              
              <span id="alg1.l15.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">return</span> <math id="alg1.l15.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathbf{x}_{0}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>𝐱</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathbf{x}_{0}</annotation></semantics></math>

</div>
</div>
<figcaption class="ltx_caption"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_float"><span id="alg1.4" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Algorithm 1</span> </span> <span id="alg1.5" class="ltx_text ltx_phantom"><span style="visibility:hidden"><sup id="alg1.5.1" class="ltx_sup">2</sup></span></span>  Conditioned Stochastic Sampler with <math id="alg1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\sigma(t)=t" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi>σ</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\sigma(t)=t</annotation></semantics></math> and <math id="alg1.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="s(t)=1" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi>s</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">s(t)=1</annotation></semantics></math>.</figcaption>
</figure>
<figure id="alg2" class="ltx_float ltx_float_algorithm ltx_framed ltx_framed_top">
<br class="ltx_break ltx_break">
<div id="alg2.1" class="ltx_listing ltx_listing">
<div id="alg2.l1" class="ltx_listingline">
              <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">1:</span>
              
              
            <span id="alg2.l1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">procedure</span> <span id="alg2.l1.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_smallcaps">StochasticEncoder</span>(<math id="alg2.l1.m1" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="D_{\theta},~t_{i\in\{0,\dots,N\}},~\gamma_{i\in\{0,\dots,N-1\}},~\mathbf{x}_{0}^{1:V},~\mathbf{z}_{0}^{1:V}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>D</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mi>θ</mi></msub><mo rspace="0.497em">,</mo><mi>t</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>∈</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">{</mo><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">…</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>N</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">}</mo></mrow></mrow></msub><mo rspace="0.497em">,</mo><mi>γ</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>∈</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">{</mo><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">…</mi><mo>,</mo><mrow><mi>N</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">}</mo></mrow></mrow></msub><mo rspace="0.497em">,</mo><mi>𝐱</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mn>0</mn></msub><msup><mrow></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mi>V</mi></mrow></msup><mo rspace="0.497em">,</mo><mi>𝐳</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mn>0</mn></msub><msup><mrow></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mi>V</mi></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">D_{\theta},~t_{i\in\{0,\dots,N\}},~\gamma_{i\in\{0,\dots,N-1\}},~\mathbf{x}_{0}^{1:V},~\mathbf{z}_{0}^{1:V}</annotation></semantics></math>)

</div>
<div id="alg2.l2" class="ltx_listingline">
              <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">2:</span>
              
              
              <span id="alg2.l2.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">sample</span> <math id="alg2.l2.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\bm{x}_{0}\sim\mathcal{N}\big(\mathbf{0},~t_{0}^{2}~\mathbf{I}\big)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>𝒙</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>∼</mo><mrow><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒩</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo maxsize="1.200em" minsize="1.200em">(</mo><mn>𝟎</mn><mo>,</mo><mrow><msubsup><mi>t</mi><mn>0</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>𝐈</mi></mrow><mo maxsize="1.200em" minsize="1.200em">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\bm{x}_{0}\sim\mathcal{N}\big(\mathbf{0},~t_{0}^{2}~\mathbf{I}\big)</annotation></semantics></math>

</div>
<div id="alg2.l3" class="ltx_listingline">
              <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">3:</span>
              
              
              <span id="alg2.l3.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">for</span> <math id="alg2.l3.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="i\in\{0,\dots,N-1\}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>∈</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">{</mo><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">…</mi><mo>,</mo><mrow><mi>N</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">}</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">i\in\{0,\dots,N-1\}</annotation></semantics></math> <span id="alg2.l3.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">do</span>
<span id="alg2.l3.4" class="ltx_text" style="float:right;"><math id="alg2.l3.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\triangleright" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo>⊳</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\triangleright</annotation></semantics></math> <math id="alg2.l3.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\gamma_{i}=\begin{cases}\scalebox{0.9}{${\min}\Big(\frac{S_{\text{churn}}}{N},\scalebox{0.8}{$\sqrt{2}{-}1$}\Big)$}&amp;\text{if }\scalebox{0.9}{$t_{i}{\in}[S_{\text{tmin}}{,}S_{\text{tmax}}]$}\\
0&amp;\text{otherwise}\end{cases}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>γ</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo>{</mo><mtable columnspacing="5pt" rowspacing="0pt"><mtr><mtd class="ltx_align_left" columnalign="left"><mpadded style="width:78.8pt;height:14.4pt;vertical-align:-3.6pt;" depth="3.6pt" height="10.8pt" width="78.8pt"><mi>min</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo maxsize="1.600em" minsize="1.600em">(</mo><mfrac><msub><mi>S</mi><mtext>churn</mtext></msub><mi>N</mi></mfrac><mo>,</mo><mpadded style="width:10.7pt;height:5.2pt;vertical-align:-0.0pt;" depth="0.0pt" height="5.2pt" width="10.7pt"><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mpadded><mo maxsize="1.600em" minsize="1.600em">)</mo></mrow></mpadded></mtd><mtd class="ltx_align_left" columnalign="left"><mrow><mtext>if </mtext><mtext>
<div class="ltx_inline-block ltx_transformed_outer" style="width:63.6pt;height:9.1pt;vertical-align:-2.3pt;"><span class="ltx_transformed_inner" style="transform:translate(-3.5pt,0.5pt) scale(0.9,0.9) ;"> 
<p class="ltx_p"><math alttext="t_{i}{\in}[S_{\text{tmin}}{,}S_{\text{tmax}}]" display="inline"><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>∈</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mrow><msub><mi>S</mi><mtext>tmin</mtext></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>S</mi><mtext>tmax</mtext></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow></math></p> 
</span></div></mtext></mrow></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd class="ltx_align_left" columnalign="left"><mn>0</mn></mtd><mtd class="ltx_align_left" columnalign="left"><mtext>otherwise</mtext></mtd></mtr></mtable></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\gamma_{i}=\begin{cases}\scalebox{0.9}{${\min}\Big(\frac{S_{\text{churn}}}{N},\scalebox{0.8}{$\sqrt{2}{-}1$}\Big)$}&amp;\text{if }\scalebox{0.9}{$t_{i}{\in}[S_{\text{tmin}}{,}S_{\text{tmax}}]$}\\
0&amp;\text{otherwise}\end{cases}</annotation></semantics></math>
</span>
</div>
<div id="alg2.l4" class="ltx_listingline">
              <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">4:</span>
              
              
               <span id="alg2.l4.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">sample</span> <math id="alg2.l4.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\bm{\epsilon}_{i}\sim\mathcal{N}\big(\mathbf{0},~S_{\text{noise}}^{2}~\mathbf{I}\big)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi class="ltx_mathvariant_bold-italic" mathvariant="bold-italic">ϵ</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>∼</mo><mrow><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒩</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo maxsize="1.200em" minsize="1.200em">(</mo><mn>𝟎</mn><mo>,</mo><mrow><msubsup><mi>S</mi><mtext>noise</mtext><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>𝐈</mi></mrow><mo maxsize="1.200em" minsize="1.200em">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\bm{\epsilon}_{i}\sim\mathcal{N}\big(\mathbf{0},~S_{\text{noise}}^{2}~\mathbf{I}\big)</annotation></semantics></math>

</div>
<div id="alg2.l5" class="ltx_listingline">
              <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">5:</span>
              
              
               <math id="alg2.l5.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\hat{t}_{i}\leftarrow t_{i}+\gamma_{i}t_{i}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>t</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">←</mo><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>+</mo><mrow><msub><mi>γ</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\hat{t}_{i}\leftarrow t_{i}+\gamma_{i}t_{i}</annotation></semantics></math>
<span id="alg2.l5.2" class="ltx_text" style="float:right;"><math id="alg2.l5.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\triangleright" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo>⊳</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\triangleright</annotation></semantics></math> Select temporarily increased noise level <math id="alg2.l5.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\hat{t}_{i}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>t</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mi>i</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\hat{t}_{i}</annotation></semantics></math>
</span>
</div>
<div id="alg2.l6" class="ltx_listingline">
              <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">6:</span>
              
              
               <math id="alg2.l6.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\bm{\hat{x}}_{i}\leftarrow\bm{x}_{i}+\raisebox{0.0pt}{$\sqrt{\raisebox{0.0pt}[7.74998pt][1.29167pt]{$\hat{t}_{i}^{2}-t_{i}^{2}$}}$}~\bm{\epsilon}_{i}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>𝒙</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">←</mo><mrow><msub><mi>𝒙</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>+</mo><mrow><mpadded voffset="0.0pt"><msqrt><mpadded voffset="0.0pt"><msubsup><mover accent="true"><mi>t</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mi>i</mi><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mo>−</mo><msubsup><mi>t</mi><mi>i</mi><mn>2</mn></msubsup></mpadded></msqrt></mpadded><mo lspace="0.330em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi class="ltx_mathvariant_bold-italic" mathvariant="bold-italic">ϵ</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\bm{\hat{x}}_{i}\leftarrow\bm{x}_{i}+\raisebox{0.0pt}{$\sqrt{\raisebox{0.0pt}[7.74998pt][1.29167pt]{$\hat{t}_{i}^{2}-t_{i}^{2}$}}$}~\bm{\epsilon}_{i}</annotation></semantics></math>
<span id="alg2.l6.2" class="ltx_text" style="float:right;"><math id="alg2.l6.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\triangleright" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo>⊳</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\triangleright</annotation></semantics></math> Add new noise to move from <math id="alg2.l6.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="t_{i}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">t_{i}</annotation></semantics></math> to <math id="alg2.l6.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="t_{i}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">t_{i}</annotation></semantics></math>
</span>
</div>
<div id="alg2.l7" class="ltx_listingline">
              <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">7:</span>
              
              
               <math id="alg2.l7.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\bm{d}_{i}\leftarrow\big(\mathbf{x}_{i}^{\tau}-D_{\theta}(\mathbf{x}_{i}^{\tau},\mathbf{z}_{0}^{\tau};t_{i})\big)/t_{i}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>𝒅</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">←</mo><mrow><mrow><mo maxsize="1.200em" minsize="1.200em">(</mo><mrow><msubsup><mi>𝐱</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>τ</mi></msubsup><mo>−</mo><mrow><msub><mi>D</mi><mi>θ</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msubsup><mi>𝐱</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>τ</mi></msubsup><mo>,</mo><msubsup><mi>𝐳</mi><mn>0</mn><mi>τ</mi></msubsup><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo maxsize="1.200em" minsize="1.200em">)</mo></mrow><mo>/</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\bm{d}_{i}\leftarrow\big(\mathbf{x}_{i}^{\tau}-D_{\theta}(\mathbf{x}_{i}^{\tau},\mathbf{z}_{0}^{\tau};t_{i})\big)/t_{i}</annotation></semantics></math>
<span id="alg2.l7.2" class="ltx_text" style="float:right;"><math id="alg2.l7.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\triangleright" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo>⊳</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\triangleright</annotation></semantics></math> Evaluate <math id="alg2.l7.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathrm{d}\mathbf{x}^{\tau}/\mathrm{d}t" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mrow><mi>d</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mi>𝐱</mi><mi>τ</mi></msup></mrow><mo>/</mo><mi>d</mi></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathrm{d}\mathbf{x}^{\tau}/\mathrm{d}t</annotation></semantics></math> at <math id="alg2.l7.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="t_{i}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">t_{i}</annotation></semantics></math>
</span>
</div>
<div id="alg2.l8" class="ltx_listingline">
              <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">8:</span>
              
              
               <math id="alg2.l8.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathbf{x}_{i+1}^{\tau}\leftarrow\mathbf{x}_{i}^{\tau}+(t_{i+1}-t_{i})\bm{d}_{i}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mi>𝐱</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>τ</mi></msubsup><mo stretchy="false">←</mo><mrow><msubsup><mi>𝐱</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>τ</mi></msubsup><mo>+</mo><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>𝒅</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathbf{x}_{i+1}^{\tau}\leftarrow\mathbf{x}_{i}^{\tau}+(t_{i+1}-t_{i})\bm{d}_{i}</annotation></semantics></math>
<span id="alg2.l8.2" class="ltx_text" style="float:right;"><math id="alg2.l8.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\triangleright" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo>⊳</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\triangleright</annotation></semantics></math> Take Euler step from <math id="alg2.l8.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="t_{i}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">t_{i}</annotation></semantics></math> to <math id="alg2.l8.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="t_{i+1}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>t</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">t_{i+1}</annotation></semantics></math>
</span>
</div>
<div id="alg2.l9" class="ltx_listingline">
              <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">9:</span>
              
              
               <span id="alg2.l9.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">if</span> <math id="alg2.l9.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="t_{i+1}\neq\sigma_{\text{max}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>≠</mo><msub><mi>σ</mi><mtext>max</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">t_{i+1}\neq\sigma_{\text{max}}</annotation></semantics></math> <span id="alg2.l9.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">then</span>

</div>
<div id="alg2.l10" class="ltx_listingline">
              <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">10:</span>
              
              
                 <math id="alg2.l10.m1" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="{\bm{d}\mathrlap{\hskip 0.74997pt{}^{\prime}}}_{i}\leftarrow\big(\mathbf{x}_{i+1}^{\tau}-D_{\theta}(\mathbf{x}_{i+1}^{\tau},\mathbf{z}_{0}^{\tau};t_{i+1})\big)/t_{i+1}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>𝒅</mi><mmultiscripts><mo stretchy="false">←</mo><mi>i</mi><mrow></mrow><mprescripts></mprescripts><mrow></mrow><mo>′</mo></mmultiscripts><mrow><mo maxsize="1.200em" minsize="1.200em">(</mo><msubsup><mi>𝐱</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>τ</mi></msubsup><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>D</mi><mi>θ</mi></msub><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msubsup><mi>𝐱</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>τ</mi></msubsup><mo>,</mo><msubsup><mi>𝐳</mi><mn>0</mn><mi>τ</mi></msubsup><mo>;</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo maxsize="1.200em" minsize="1.200em">)</mo></mrow><mo>/</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{\bm{d}\mathrlap{\hskip 0.74997pt{}^{\prime}}}_{i}\leftarrow\big(\mathbf{x}_{i+1}^{\tau}-D_{\theta}(\mathbf{x}_{i+1}^{\tau},\mathbf{z}_{0}^{\tau};t_{i+1})\big)/t_{i+1}</annotation></semantics></math>
<span id="alg2.l10.2" class="ltx_text" style="float:right;"><math id="alg2.l10.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\triangleright" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo>⊳</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\triangleright</annotation></semantics></math> Apply 2<sup id="alg2.l10.2.1" class="ltx_sup">nd</sup> order correction
</span>
</div>
<div id="alg2.l11" class="ltx_listingline">
              <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">11:</span>
              
              
                 <math id="alg2.l11.m1" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="\mathbf{x}_{i+1}^{\tau}\leftarrow\mathbf{x}_{i}^{\tau}+(t_{i+1}-t_{i})\big(\frac{1}{2}\bm{d}_{i}+\frac{1}{2}{\bm{d}\mathrlap{\hskip 0.74997pt{}^{\prime}}}_{i}\big)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mi>𝐱</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>τ</mi></msubsup><mo stretchy="false">←</mo><msubsup><mi>𝐱</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>τ</mi></msubsup><mo>+</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mrow><mo maxsize="1.200em" minsize="1.200em">(</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><msub><mi>𝒅</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mi>𝒅</mi><mmultiscripts><mo maxsize="1.200em" minsize="1.200em">)</mo><mi>i</mi><mrow></mrow><mprescripts></mprescripts><mrow></mrow><mo>′</mo></mmultiscripts></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathbf{x}_{i+1}^{\tau}\leftarrow\mathbf{x}_{i}^{\tau}+(t_{i+1}-t_{i})\big(\frac{1}{2}\bm{d}_{i}+\frac{1}{2}{\bm{d}\mathrlap{\hskip 0.74997pt{}^{\prime}}}_{i}\big)</annotation></semantics></math>
     
</div>
<div id="alg2.l12" class="ltx_listingline">
              <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">12:</span>
              
              
              <span id="alg2.l12.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">return</span> <math id="alg2.l12.m1" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="\mathbf{x}_{N}^{1:V}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>𝐱</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mi>N</mi></msub><msup><mrow></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mi>V</mi></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathbf{x}_{N}^{1:V}</annotation></semantics></math>

</div>
</div>
<figcaption class="ltx_caption"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_float"><span id="alg2.4" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Algorithm 2</span> </span> <span id="alg2.5" class="ltx_text ltx_phantom"><span style="visibility:hidden"><sup id="alg2.5.1" class="ltx_sup">2</sup></span></span>  Stochastic Encoding with <math id="alg2.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\sigma(t)=t" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi>σ</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\sigma(t)=t</annotation></semantics></math> and <math id="alg2.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="s(t)=1" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi>s</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">s(t)=1</annotation></semantics></math>.</figcaption>
</figure>
</section>
</section>
<section id="A3" class="ltx_appendix">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_appendix">Appendix C </span>Hyper-parameters</h2>

<div id="A3.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A3.p1.1" class="ltx_p">The hyperparameters used in our autoencoder are listed in Tab. <a href="#A3.T6" title="Table 6 ‣ Appendix C Hyper-parameters ‣ DiffSDA: Unsupervised Diffusion Sequential Disentanglement Across Modalities" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">6</span></a> and Tab. <a href="#A3.T7" title="Table 7 ‣ Appendix C Hyper-parameters ‣ DiffSDA: Unsupervised Diffusion Sequential Disentanglement Across Modalities" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">7</span></a>, detailing the configurations for each dataset: MUG, TaiChi-HD, VoxCeleb, CelebV-HQ, TIMIT, LibriSpeech, PhysioNet, Air Quality and ETTh1. We provide the values of essential parameters such as sequence lengths, batch sizes, learning rates, and the use of <math id="A3.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="P_{\text{mean}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>P</mi><mtext>mean</mtext></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">P_{\text{mean}}</annotation></semantics></math> and <math id="A3.p1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="P_{\text{std}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>P</mi><mtext>std</mtext></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">P_{\text{std}}</annotation></semantics></math> to manage noise disturbance during training. In addition, the table specifies whether VQ-VAE was employed. Tab. <a href="#A3.T8" title="Table 8 ‣ Appendix C Hyper-parameters ‣ DiffSDA: Unsupervised Diffusion Sequential Disentanglement Across Modalities" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">8</span></a> outlines the architecture of our latent DDIM model, including batch size, number of epochs, MLP layers, hidden sizes, and the <math id="A3.p1.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\beta" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>β</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\beta</annotation></semantics></math> scheduler. These details are essential for understanding the model’s structure and its training process. For the VQ-VAE model, we utilized the pre-trained model from <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_citep">(<a href="#bib.bib56" title="" class="ltx_ref">Rombach et al., 2022</a>)</cite> with hyperparameters <math id="A3.p1.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="f=8" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>8</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">f=8</annotation></semantics></math>, <math id="A3.p1.m5" class="ltx_Math" alttext="Z=256" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>Z</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>256</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">Z=256</annotation></semantics></math>, and <math id="A3.p1.m6" class="ltx_Math" alttext="d=4" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">d=4</annotation></semantics></math>, which encodes a frame of size <math id="A3.p1.m7" class="ltx_Math" alttext="3\times 256\times 256" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">×</mo><mn>256</mn><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">×</mo><mn>256</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">3\times 256\times 256</annotation></semantics></math> into a latent representation of size <math id="A3.p1.m8" class="ltx_Math" alttext="4\times 32\times 32" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">×</mo><mn>32</mn><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">×</mo><mn>32</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">4\times 32\times 32</annotation></semantics></math>.</p>
</div>
